---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="Privacy Notice | K & D Auto Electric" description="Privacy notice for K & D Auto Electric, Inc. in Somerset, PA." canonical="https://kdautoelectric.com/privacy-notice">
  <section class="relative bg-gradient-to-br from-kd-black via-kd-gray-900 to-kd-red/20 py-16">
    <div class="relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <nav class="text-sm text-kd-gray-400 mb-6">
        <a href="/" class="hover:text-kd-yellow transition-colors">Home</a>
        <span class="mx-2">/</span>
        <span class="text-kd-yellow">Privacy Notice</span>
      </nav>
      <h1 class="text-3xl sm:text-4xl font-black text-kd-white">Privacy Notice</h1>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="py-12 bg-kd-white">
    <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 prose prose-gray">
      <p class="text-sm text-kd-gray-500">Last updated: August 1, 2026</p>

      <h2>Information We Collect</h2>
      <p>When you contact us by phone, email, in person, or otherwise provide information directly, we may collect information such as your name, phone number, email address, vehicle information, and the details of your request.</p>
      <p>When you visit this website, Google Analytics may collect information such as pages viewed, session activity, approximate location, browser type, device type, operating system, and a client identifier stored in a first-party cookie.</p>

      <h2>How We Use Your Information</h2>
      <p>We use information you provide to respond to inquiries, schedule and provide automotive services, communicate with customers, maintain appropriate business records, and improve our website and services.</p>
      <p>Website analytics are used to understand how visitors use the site and to identify technical or usability improvements.</p>
      <p>We do not sell or rent personal information to third parties for their marketing purposes.</p>

      <h2>Cookies and Google Analytics</h2>
      <p>This website uses Google Analytics, which may use cookies and similar technologies to measure website activity. You can control cookies through your browser settings. Google also provides a <a href="https://tools.google.com/dlpage/gaoptout" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="underline underline-offset-2">Google Analytics opt-out browser add-on</a>.</p>

      <h2>Google Maps and External Links</h2>
      <p>The Contact page includes an embedded Google map. When the map loads, your browser communicates directly with Google, and Google may receive standard technical information associated with the request.</p>
      <p>This website also contains links to K&amp;D Auto Electric&rsquo;s pages on Google, including links for reading and writing customer reviews. When you follow those links, you leave this website and interact directly with Google.</p>
      <p>Google&rsquo;s handling of information is governed by the <a href="https://policies.google.com/privacy" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="underline underline-offset-2">Google Privacy Policy</a> and <a href="https://policies.google.com/terms" target="_blank" rel="noopener noreferrer" class="underline underline-offset-2">Google Terms of Service</a>.</p>

      <h2>AI-Assisted Customer Review Summary</h2>
      <p>The homepage contains a static, AI-assisted summary based on customer reviews published on Google. The summary was prepared for this website and is not generated, approved, or endorsed by Google.</p>
      <p>Viewing the summary does not cause this website to request review content from the Google Places API. The summary is stored as ordinary website content. Google receives information only when a visitor loads the embedded Google map or follows one of the links to Google.</p>

      <h2>Data Security</h2>
      <p>We use reasonable administrative and technical measures to protect personal information. However, no method of electronic storage or transmission is completely secure, and absolute security cannot be guaranteed.</p>

      <h2>Contact</h2>
      <p>If you have questions about this privacy notice, please contact us at:</p>
      <p>
        K &amp; D Auto Electric, Inc.<br />
        212 Forward Boulevard<br />
        Somerset, PA 15501<br />
        (814) 443-3615
      </p>
    </div>
  </section>
</Layout>
